  "description": "DidiSoft OpenPGP Library for .NET provides simple yet powerful API for working with PGP files, streams and messages. \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\tOnline Tutorial with many examples can be found at https://www.didisoft.com/net-openpgp/examples/\n\t\t\n\t\tAPI documentation can be found on the web http://sdk.didisoft.com/pgplib.net/",
