  "releaseNotes": "version 1.9.5 - Migrated to BouncyCastle 2.5\n\t\tversion 1.9.4 - Async Cryptography methods with CancellationToken parameters, Support for AEAD in OpenPGP decryption\n\t\tversion 1.9.3 - Full support for OpenPGP over Curve-25519\n\t\tversion 1.9.2 - Added support for OpenPGP cryptography over Curve-25519\n\t\tversion 1.9.1 - Added support for Yubikey NEO OpenPGP smart card\n\t\tversion 1.9.0 - Added support for the new GnuPG KBX public key storage format and EdDSA public keys",
